        "description": "College specialized in fisheries management, aquaculture technology, fish processing, and sustainable development of fish resources.",
        "mission": "The College aims to produce qualified graduates to manage and develop fish resources in the Arabian countries through preparing cadres capable of fisheries management, aquaculture, fish processing, compliance with fisheries and IMO laws, and supporting sustainable development through education, research, outreach, and technical consultation.",
